    "head(path: str, kwargs: dict[str, str], timeout: float | None, delay: float) -> response: Response": |
      Same as get, issuing a HEAD. Use `requests`.
    "options(path: str, kwargs: dict[str, str], timeout: float | None, delay: float) -> response: Response": |
