      Async GET through the long-lived `httpx` AsyncClient. Same Algorithm and
      Requirements as Requests.aget (single request when `timeout` is None, else
      delegate to `apoll`), executed against the held AsyncClient.

      Use `httpx` for execution.
    "apost(path: str, kwargs: dict[str, str], timeout: float | None, delay: float) -> response: AsyncResponse": |
      Same as aget, issuing a POST. Use `httpx`.
